{"content": "<!-- awi-geo-start -->\n<h2>Berapa harga BYD M6 DM di Makassar?</h2>\n<p>Harga OTR BYD M6 DM di Makassar mulai Rp311.400.000. BYD M6 DM adalah MPV plug-in hybrid (PHEV) 7 penumpang yang menggabungkan mesin bensin 1.5L dan motor listrik, tersedia dalam 5 tipe, dan dijual resmi oleh BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar, dealer resmi BYD dan Denza di Jl. Ahmad Yani No. 15, Makassar, Sulawesi Selatan. Semua harga di bawah adalah harga on the road (OTR) Makassar. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini.</p>\n<h2>Tipe dan harga OTR BYD M6 DM Makassar</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>BYD M6 DM Classic Standard</strong>: Rp311.400.000 OTR Makassar</li><li><strong>BYD M6 DM Classic Dynamic</strong>: Rp331.400.000 OTR Makassar</li><li><strong>BYD M6 DM Cross Advanced</strong>: Rp373.400.000 OTR Makassar</li><li><strong>BYD M6 DM Cross Superior 7 Seater</strong>: Rp393.400.000 OTR Makassar</li><li><strong>BYD M6 DM Superior Captain Seat</strong>: Rp403.400.000 OTR Makassar</li></ul>\n<h2>Test drive dan simulasi kredit BYD M6 DM di Makassar</h2>\n<p>Showroom BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar buka Senin sampai Sabtu pukul 08.00 sampai 17.00 WITA dan Minggu pukul 09.00 sampai 17.00 WITA. Untuk jadwal test drive, simulasi kredit, atau cek stok BYD M6 DM, hubungi Sales Consultant AWI lewat <a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20mau%20tanya%20harga%20OTR%20dan%20test%20drive%20BYD%20M6%20DM%20di%20Makassar.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp 0822-5945-2349</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Bandingkan harga model BYD lain di Makassar:</strong> <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-atto-1/\">Harga BYD Atto 1 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-dolphin/\">Harga BYD Dolphin Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-atto-3/\">Harga BYD Atto 3 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-m6/\">Harga BYD M6 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-seal/\">Harga BYD Seal Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-sealion-7/\">Harga BYD Sealion 7 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-denza-d9/\">Harga Denza D9 Makassar</a>. Lihat juga <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/harga-byd-makassar/\">daftar harga semua mobil BYD Makassar 2026</a>.</p>\n<!-- awi-geo-end -->\n\n<p style=\"margin:30px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">BYD M6 DM</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#111111\">One Car. Every Family Story. MPV Hybrid 7 Penumpang untuk Keluarga Makassar</h2><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-makassar-hero.webp\" alt=\"BYD M6 DM MPV plug-in hybrid warna Crystal White di dealer resmi BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar\" width=\"1400\" height=\"653\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" /><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-m6-dm/\"><strong>BYD M6 DM</strong></a> adalah MPV plug-in hybrid (PHEV) 7 penumpang yang menemani keluarga dari rutinitas harian di Makassar sampai perjalanan jauh ke Toraja, Bone, atau Bulukumba. Dengan teknologi DM (Dual Mode), M6 DM bisa berjalan murni listrik untuk jarak dekat lalu otomatis memadukan motor listrik dan mesin bensin 1.5 L saat dibutuhkan, jadi tidak perlu khawatir mencari SPKLU di luar kota.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Tersedia 5 tipe dalam dua varian, <strong>Classic</strong> dan <strong>Cross</strong>, dengan harga OTR Makassar mulai <strong>Rp311.400.000</strong>. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini.</p><a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20lihat%20halaman%20BYD%20M6%20DM%20di%20website%20BYD%20Makassar.%20Mau%20tanya%20harga%20OTR%20dan%20jadwal%20test%20drive.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin:0 10px 10px 0\">Chat AWI untuk Test Drive M6 DM</a><a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/simulasi-kredit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#111111;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin:0 10px 10px 0\">Simulasi Kredit</a>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Harga</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Tipe dan Harga OTR BYD M6 DM Makassar</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 10px\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;background:#fff\"><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Tipe</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Harga OTR Makassar</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Ciri utama</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Classic Standard</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp311.400.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">7 kursi, kain, layar 10,1\"</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Classic Dynamic</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp331.400.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">7 kursi, kamera 360°, 6 airbag</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Cross Advanced</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp373.400.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">7 kursi, kulit sintetis, layar 12,8\", EV 110 km</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Cross Superior</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp393.400.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">7 kursi, ADAS lengkap, tailgate elektrik</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Cross Superior Captain Seat</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp403.400.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">6 kursi captain seat, panoramic glass roof, ADAS lengkap</td></tr></table></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;color:#777;line-height:1.5\">Harga OTR Makassar sesuai pricelist resmi dan dapat berubah sewaktu-waktu. Bandingkan dengan model lain di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/harga-byd-makassar/\">Daftar Harga BYD Makassar</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">DM Technology</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Listrik Saat Bisa, Bensin Saat Perlu</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Platform Intelligent Dual Mode membaca kondisi jalan dan berpindah mulus antara tenaga listrik dan mesin bensin. Senyap saat bisa, bertenaga saat dibutuhkan, dan selalu efisien.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-dm-technology.webp\" alt=\"Teknologi DM (Dual Mode) BYD M6 DM listrik dan bensin\" width=\"516\" height=\"172\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:516px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 18px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Jarak listrik (Cross)</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">110<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> km NEDC</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Motor listrik</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">120<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> kW / 210 Nm</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Tangki bensin</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">52<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> liter</span></div></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Untuk pemakaian harian di dalam kota Makassar, tipe Cross bisa menempuh hingga 110 km (NEDC) hanya dengan listrik, sedangkan tipe Classic hingga 45 km. Baterai bisa dicas di rumah (AC 3,3 kW), dan tipe Cross juga mendukung pengisian cepat DC 26 kW. Begitu baterai menipis, mesin 1.5 L ikut bekerja, jadi perjalanan jauh tetap aman. Hitung penghematannya di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/kalkulator-hemat/\">Kalkulator Hemat BBM vs Listrik</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Performa</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Instant Torque &amp; Smooth Acceleration</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Tenaga langsung terasa begitu pedal gas diinjak, dan tipe Cross bisa berakselerasi 0–100 km/jam dalam 9,1 detik. Nyaman untuk menyalip di jalan poros antarkabupaten maupun masuk tol dalam kota.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-akselerasi.webp\" alt=\"BYD M6 DM melaju di jalan dengan akselerasi responsif\" width=\"500\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:500px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Desain</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Cross Over Fender &amp; Panoramic Glass Roof</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Tipe Cross tampil lebih gagah dengan fender cross over dan roof rack. Tipe Cross Superior Captain Seat juga dilengkapi panoramic glass roof yang membuat kabin terasa lebih terang dan lapang.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-cross-over-fender.webp\" alt=\"Cross over fender BYD M6 DM Cross tampak belakang\" width=\"724\" height=\"404\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:724px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Cross over fender</strong>, bodi lebih lebar dan berkarakter (tipe Cross).</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-panoramic-glass-roof.webp\" alt=\"Panoramic glass roof BYD M6 DM Cross\" width=\"1400\" height=\"754\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Panoramic glass roof</strong> (tipe Cross Superior Captain Seat).</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Kabin</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Spacious Design Cabin</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Ruang untuk semua anggota keluarga, tanpa terasa sesak. Pilihan konfigurasi 7 kursi (2+3+2) atau 6 kursi dengan captain seat di baris tengah.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-kabin.webp\" alt=\"Kabin lega BYD M6 DM Cross\" width=\"342\" height=\"267\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:342px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Kabin lega</strong> dengan interior Black + Brown (tipe Cross).</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-layar-12-8-inci.webp\" alt=\"Layar sentuh 12,8 inci BYD M6 DM Cross\" width=\"468\" height=\"308\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:468px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Layar sentuh 12,8 inci</strong> dan panel instrumen 10,25 inci full LCD (tipe Cross).</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-electric-column-shifter.webp\" alt=\"Electric column shifter BYD M6 DM\" width=\"376\" height=\"224\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:376px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Electric column shifter</strong> di balik setir, ruang konsol tengah jadi lebih lega.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 20px;padding:0;line-height:1.8;color:#333\"><li>Apple CarPlay, Android Auto, dan Bluetooth di semua tipe</li><li>Wireless charger untuk HP (Cross Superior dan Cross Superior Captain Seat)</li><li>Jok kulit sintetis, jok pengemudi elektrik 6 arah (tipe Cross)</li><li>Bagasi 190 L, bisa diperluas hingga 580 L</li><li>Tailgate elektrik dengan remote (Cross Superior dan Cross Superior Captain Seat)</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Keselamatan</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Aman untuk Seluruh Keluarga</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 20px;padding:0;line-height:1.8;color:#333\"><li>Airbag depan di semua tipe; airbag samping dan tirai mulai Classic Dynamic</li><li>Kamera 360° mulai Classic Dynamic; kamera mundur di Classic Standard</li><li>ABS, ESC, TCS, EBD, Hill Hold Control, rem parkir elektrik dengan Auto Hold, TPMS, dan ISOFIX di semua tipe</li><li><strong>ADAS lengkap</strong> di Cross Superior dan Cross Superior Captain Seat: Adaptive &amp; Intelligent Cruise Control, Automatic Emergency Braking, Predictive Collision Warning, Rear Collision Warning, Blind Spot Detection, Door Open Warning, Rear Cross Traffic Alert &amp; Brake, Lane Departure Assist, dan Emergency Lane Keeping Assist</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Pilihan Warna</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Exterior Colors Option</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">4 pilihan warna eksterior. Interior Black untuk tipe Classic dan Black + Brown untuk tipe Cross.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-crystal-white.webp\" alt=\"BYD M6 DM warna Crystal White\" width=\"552\" height=\"308\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Crystal White</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-quartz-blue.webp\" alt=\"BYD M6 DM warna Quartz Blue\" width=\"552\" height=\"312\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Quartz Blue</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-cosmos-black.webp\" alt=\"BYD M6 DM warna Cosmos Black\" width=\"552\" height=\"312\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Cosmos Black</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-m6-dm-harbour-grey.webp\" alt=\"BYD M6 DM warna Harbour Grey\" width=\"552\" height=\"312\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Harbour Grey</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Spesifikasi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Spesifikasi Lengkap BYD M6 DM</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 10px\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;background:#fff\"><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Dimensi</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Panjang x Lebar x Tinggi</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Classic 4.680 x 1.810 x 1.695 mm · Cross 4.710 x 1.830 x 1.695 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak sumbu roda</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>2.800 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak pijak depan / belakang</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>1.540 / 1.530 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Radius putar minimum</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>5,8 m</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Ground clearance (berbeban)</td><td style=\"padding